            "title": "Why Is Hamilton Lane (HLNE) Stock Soaring Today",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "Shares of alternative investment management firm Hamilton Lane (NASDAQ:HLNE) jumped 6.7% in the morning session after the company reported third-quarter 2025 results that significantly surpassed analyst expectations. The alternative investment management firm posted revenue of $190.9 million, a 27.3% increase from the same period in the previous year and 12.8% above Wall Street's estimates. Earnings per share also showed significant strength, with adjusted EPS of $1.54, which was nearly 40% high",
